        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Cost-control initiatives could decrease the price we might establish for products that we may develop or sell, which would result in lower product revenues or royalties payable to us.",
        "start_character": 149442,
        "end_character": 149625
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-103276",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-103276-0ec866cb8559f609",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-103276",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Many of the companies against which we are competing or against which we may compete in the future have significantly greater financial resources, established presence in the market and expertise in research and development, manufacturing, preclinical testing, conducting clinical trials, obtaining regulatory approvals and marketing approved products than we do.",
        "start_character": 82721,
        "end_character": 83084
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-103276",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-103276-0ec866cb8559f609",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-103276",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our commercial opportunity could be reduced or eliminated if our competitors develop and commercialize products that are more effective, have fewer or less severe side effects, are more convenient or are less expensive than any products that we may develop.",
        "start_character": 83856,
        "end_character": 84113
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-103276",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-103276-0ec866cb8559f609",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-103276",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our competitors also may obtain FDA or other regulatory approval for their products more rapidly than we may obtain approval for ours, which could result in our competitors establishing a strong market position before we are able to enter the market, especially for any competitor developing a live biotherapeutic which will likely share our same regulatory approval requirements.",
        "start_character": 84114,
        "end_character": 84494
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-103276",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-103276-0ec866cb8559f609",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-103276",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The key competitive factors affecting the success of the product candidates that we develop, if approved, are likely to be their efficacy, safety, convenience, price, the level of competition and the availability of reimbursement from government and other third-party payors.",
        "start_character": 83580,
        "end_character": 83855
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-103276",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-103276-0ec866cb8559f609",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-103276",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To develop master cell banks, working cell banks, and bulk drug substance for commercial product, we are using bacterial strains that each originate from a unique research cell bank precursor, so we expect the research cell banks and final drug product should be genetically and physiologically similar.",
        "start_character": 71808,
        "end_character": 72111
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-103276",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-103276-0ec866cb8559f609",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-103276",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are a clinical-stage company focused on improving patient outcomes in medically vulnerable populations through discovery and development of novel live biotherapeutic product, or LBP, candidates.",
        "start_character": 26,
        "end_character": 223
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-103276",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-103276-0ec866cb8559f609",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-103276",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are aware of a number of large pharmaceutical and biotechnology companies, as well as smaller, early-stage companies, that are pursuing the development of products, including live biotherapeutics, and disease indications we are targeting.",
        "start_character": 82198,
        "end_character": 82439
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-103276",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-103276-0ec866cb8559f609",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-103276",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that the scientific and clinical data from the development of VOWST (our then product candidate SER-109 program) and the data from the SER-155 Phase 1b study (described below) validate our novel therapeutic approach in both infectious disease and I&I diseases.",
